Subject: [PATCH] docs: explain tenv lockfile behavior for parallel runs (#302)

Adds a new section to the documentation explaining how tenv handles
lockfiles when multiple tenv instances run in parallel (e.g. across
multiple shells or CI jobs).

Closes #302.

